{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"67c705a6-cab6-4803-8a9e-42f758215f36","step":{"id":"s1","script":"Absolute value tells us how far a number is from zero. Start with three on a number line.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Absolute value = distance from zero"},{"op":"figure","id":"line","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-5,5],"y":[-1.5,2],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"axis","from":[-4.6,0],"to":[4.6,0]},{"kind":"point","id":"zero","at":[0,0],"label":"0"},{"kind":"point","id":"pos","at":[3,0],"label":"3"},{"kind":"segment","from":[-4,-0.12],"to":[-4,0.12]},{"kind":"segment","from":[-2,-0.12],"to":[-2,0.12]},{"kind":"segment","from":[2,-0.12],"to":[2,0.12]},{"kind":"segment","from":[4,-0.12],"to":[4,0.12]}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"67c705a6-cab6-4803-8a9e-42f758215f36","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Three is three units from zero, so its absolute value is three.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"posdist","on":"line","marks":[{"kind":"measure","from":{"at":"zero"},"to":{"at":"pos"},"label":"3 units"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"poseq","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|3|=3"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"67c705a6-cab6-4803-8a9e-42f758215f36","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Negative three lies on the other side, but it is also three units from zero. Distance does not carry a negative sign.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"negdist","on":"line","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"neg","at":[-3,0],"label":"−3"},{"kind":"measure","from":{"at":"neg"},"to":{"at":"zero"},"label":"3 units"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"negeq","anchor":{"el":"poseq","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|-3|=3"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"What is |−4|, and why?","expected_gist":"4, because −4 is four units from zero."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"67c705a6-cab6-4803-8a9e-42f758215f36","step":{"id":"s4","script":"Absolute value is never negative. Zero has absolute value zero because it is already at zero.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"zeronote","on":"line","marks":[{"kind":"text","at":[0,-0.85],"text":"zero distance","size":"small"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"zeroeq","anchor":{"el":"negeq","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"|0|=0\\qquad |x|\\geq 0"}],"checkpoint":null}}
